      "1": {
       "raw": "\n\nThe robe takes 2 bolts of blue fiber.\nIt takes half that much white fiber, which is 2 / 2 = <<2/2=1>>1 bolt of white fiber.\nIn total, it takes 2 + 1 = <<2+1=3>>3 bolts.\n#### 3",
