      "3": {
       "raw": "\n\nHe runs 3 sprints 3 times a week, so he runs a total of 3 x 3 = <<3*3=9>>9 sprints a week.\nEach sprint is 60 meters, so he runs a total of 9 x 60 = <<9*60=540>>540 meters a week.\n#### 540",
       "strict-match": {
        "exact_match": 1.0,
        "response": "540"
       },
       "flexible-extract": {
        "exact_match": 1.0,
        "response": "540"
